# Generated from go.mod by scripts/gen-third-party-notices.sh. Not committed:
# the licence gate is the script's own exit status, not a comparison against a
# stored copy, and a stored copy only went stale on every dependency bump --
# which Dependabot cannot fix, since it cannot run the script. The release
# generates it and ships it in chirp-notices.zip, where the fonts' OFL and
# Bitstream-Vera obligations actually apply.
/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
